  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture a.ts with relative imports of missing ./local and ./types reproduces both shapes: FromLocal -extends-> typescript:external:0-0:Local:external_symbol and class C -extends-> ...:Unextracted:external_symbol (origin inheritance-linker). js_ts.py:3422 still drops these; _external_base_edge (inheritance.py:327) has no relative-import check. The class case, previously unmeasured, is now confirmed. MECHANISM: analyzer's intra-repo drop of a relative-import base is an absence the core Approach-C fallback cannot see, so it mints an external base."  # 18bb
